    "en": "In the past 8 hours the ecosystem added 10 new plugins and the official repo gained 73 stars, alongside the dsh 0.1.7-rc.1 release; dataelement/dsh-desktop led growth at +34 stars. However, 12,760 of 15,965 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving the health score at 36 — worth watching.",
